# The shape never changes in the loop, so the test of its class and the read behind it are the same in every turn. `radius` is a field of a Circle only: the read is valid only where the test has passed. As emitted, it stands behind the branch.
# EMITTED-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# EMITTED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# EMITTED: Int32 b@[[isCircle]] = Equal(b@{{*}}, $-{{*}}:TypeTest)
# EMITTED-NEXT: Branch(b@[[isCircle]], Terminal
# EMITTED: Load(b@{{*}}, offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# EMITTED-LABEL: end of function
# What the test leaves of the shape holds for the whole loop, so the test stands in front of two loops, one for each class. Hoisting lifts the load of the field out of the loop of the Circle, to where the loop is entered. No load of a field comes in front of the branch.
# HOISTED-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# HOISTED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# HOISTED: Int32 b@[[word]] = Load(b@[[shape]], offset = 12, ControlDependent|ReadsImmutable|Reads:AOTObject_shapeWord
# HOISTED: Int32 b@[[isCircle]] = Equal(b@[[word]], $-{{*}}:TypeTest)
# HOISTED-NEXT: Branch(b@[[isCircle]], Terminal
# HOISTED-NEXT: Successors: Then:#[[behind]], Else:#
# HOISTED-NEXT: BB#[[behind]]:
# HOISTED-NEXT: Predecessors: #0
# HOISTED-NOT: Phi(
# HOISTED: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@[[shape]], offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# HOISTED-NEXT: Jump(
# HOISTED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# HOISTED-LABEL: end of function
# Nothing is left for the step that makes two versions of a loop: the load stays where it is.
# VERSIONED-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# VERSIONED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# VERSIONED: Int32 b@[[isCircle]] = Equal(b@{{*}}, $-{{*}}:TypeTest)
# VERSIONED-NEXT: Branch(b@[[isCircle]], Terminal
# VERSIONED-NEXT: Successors: Then:#[[behind]], Else:#
# VERSIONED-NEXT: BB#[[behind]]:
# VERSIONED-NEXT: Predecessors: #0
# VERSIONED-NOT: Phi(
# VERSIONED: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@{{*}}, offset = 16, ControlDependent|Reads:ObjectFields{{*}}:GetSlot)
# VERSIONED-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# VERSIONED-LABEL: end of function
# It is still there after the last step. The shape word is read once, and this is the only load of the field that is left. It runs only if the loop has a turn.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="total" role=Source
# CHECK-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[word]] = Load(b@[[shape]], offset = 12, ControlDependent|ReadsImmutable|Reads:AOTObject_shapeWord
# CHECK-NOT: Reads:
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[isCircle]] = Equal(b@[[word]], $-{{*}}:TypeTest)
# CHECK-NOT: Reads:
# CHECK: Branch(b@[[isCircle]], Terminal
# CHECK-NEXT: Successors: Then:#[[behind]], Else:#
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#[[behind]]:
# CHECK-NEXT: Predecessors: #0
# CHECK-NOT: Phi(
